This dataset was produced in an isolated, GenseeAI-controlled security lab. It
contains sanitized records of an AI-agent experiment and no customer or end-user
data. The trace includes the sanitized benchmark prompt, run configuration, and
output generated by `gpt-5.6-sol` through the OpenAI API using OpenAI Codex CLI
0.148.0. It also contains event and request records produced while using:

- Sonatype Nexus Repository Community Edition 3.93.2. No Nexus binary or source
  code is redistributed in this dataset.
- Falco and Sysdig capture/replay tooling. No Falco or Sysdig binary or source
  code is redistributed in this dataset.

CVE identifiers and vulnerability descriptions are public factual references.
The controlled challenge value, authentication material, provider metadata, raw
model reasoning, and raw syscall capture are not distributed.

